<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/1/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Upon the commencement of this Act, references to the Director General of Gas Supply, a Director of Gas Supply or an authorised officer in any written law, including any subsidiary legislation, or in any document, registration, approval, certificate, directive, order, guideline, notification or other document made, issued or given before the commencement of this Act shall be construed as provided for in subsections (2), (3), (4) and (5)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/1/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/1/eng@/~cl_27> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/1/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/1/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/1/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/1/eng@/~cl_27__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "References to the Director General of Gas Supply or a Director of Gas Supply in relation to the functions of such Director General or Director which upon the commencement of this Act become the functions of the Commission shall be construed as references to the Commission."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2001/1/eng@> .
